/S /P
/E (Unlock the potential of wireless communication in IoT with this targeted set of courses. Gain hands-on experience with the ESP32, Bluetooth, and BLE, and understand how to establish reliable connections in various environments. Master WiFi communication techniques and explore long-distance options like Cellular, LoRa, and NBIOT. Finally, dive into the MQTT protocol, an essential component for efficient data exchange in modern IoT systems. This group equips you with the skills to design robust communication frameworks for diverse IoT applications.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
