/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Elevate your IoT development skills with cloud computing and full-stack programming expertise. This group covers certification training for leading cloud platforms, Azure and AWS, enabling you to leverage cloud services for scalable IoT solutions. Complement this knowledge with full-stack development using the MERN \(Mongo DB, Express JS, React JS, Node JS\) stack, Flask framework and Raspberry Pi, and learn how to create visually engaging, data-driven applications. Additionally, explore Node-RED, a powerful tool for wiring together devices, APIs, and online services, making IoT development faster and more intuitive. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
