<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Demonstrate your knowledge and skills acquired in the huebits industry ready program in Internet of Things by Designing and Implementing an end-to-end IoT system involving Hardware, Software and Networking elements. In this six week Capstone project, you will be able to design, build and implement a prototype IoT system which encapsulates analysis of environments amenable for IoT implementation by arriving at project goals, various design choices and trade-offs you would make in arriving at practical solutions to real-world problems. During the course of this project, you will have a chance to revisit some topics and reflect on the learnings from previous course modules while you adapt them for your application.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
