/E (In this capstone project, you'll have the freedom to creatively define and solve a problem, guided by expert mentors. You will implement a full-stack solution, from hardware setup to cloud integration and application development. Following industry-standard methodologies like Agile, you'll produce key deliverables, including project documentation and test cases. Your final evaluation will include a video presentation showcasing your project, technical skills, and detailed reports. Under the guidance of AI powered CapstoneGPT magic and industry experts, you will follow a six-week structured project plan to:)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
